                "nl": "Schakel laden vanaf het net [[charge_from_grid]]",
                "sv": "Slå [[charge_from_grid]] laddning från elnätet",
                "de": "Laden aus dem Netz [[charge_from_grid]]schalten"
            },
            "hint": {
                "en": "Allow the Libbi to charge from the grid. It only charges up to the charge target, and only during the cheap periods of the tariff set in the myenergi app.",
